WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.378 --> 00:00:02.711
(pop music)

00:00:04.776 --> 00:00:05.854
- [Chance] How many people
have the opportunity

00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:07.899
to be a world champion at anything?

00:00:07.899 --> 00:00:09.000
We have the opportunity to do something

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.029
that no one else does.

00:00:10.029 --> 00:00:11.854
This isn't played anywhere
else in the world.

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:13.026
So yeah, like, it's serious.

00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:14.617
Like, we want to win.

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:16.950
(pop music)

00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:22.498
- We're here to watch Unicycle Football.

00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:24.701
It's football on unicycles.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:27.929
(rock music)

00:00:27.929 --> 00:00:32.280
- We stick to NFL rules
as closely as possible.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.655
Except are a few exceptions
because we're riding a unicycle.

00:00:34.655 --> 00:00:37.979
- We play five on five,
two receivers, a blocker,

00:00:37.979 --> 00:00:39.522
a center, and a quarterback.

00:00:39.522 --> 00:00:42.564
Everything has to be done on a wheel.

00:00:42.564 --> 00:00:44.719
The second your foot touches the ground,

00:00:44.719 --> 00:00:45.970
you're done.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.094
- Each team plays 14 games,

00:00:47.094 --> 00:00:49.292
there's 56 regular season games total.

00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:51.865
Then wild card playoffs, then playoffs,

00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:53.117
and then the Stupor Bowl.

00:00:53.117 --> 00:00:54.035
- Every Sunday,

00:00:54.035 --> 00:00:56.748
some people have been doing
this for 10 years now.

00:00:56.748 --> 00:00:58.527
My team the Blackouts, we're undefeated,

00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:00.259
and we're going to be
playing the reigning champs,

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:01.618
the Herons.

00:01:01.618 --> 00:01:02.926
- Bulldoze them over.

00:01:02.926 --> 00:01:04.002
Bulldoze them.

00:01:04.002 --> 00:01:04.835
- [Charlie] This game is very important

00:01:04.835 --> 00:01:05.781
because we want to maintain

00:01:05.781 --> 00:01:09.255
our undefeated status leading
up to the Stupor Bowl.

00:01:09.255 --> 00:01:10.189
- [Dane] They're
definitely gunning for us.

00:01:10.189 --> 00:01:11.846
They're practicing just for us.

00:01:11.846 --> 00:01:14.464
(pop music)

00:01:14.464 --> 00:01:15.297
- [Charlie] I think that a lot of times

00:01:15.297 --> 00:01:17.229
people come to this game.

00:01:17.229 --> 00:01:20.642
What shocks them is the level of play.

00:01:20.642 --> 00:01:22.655
We're crashing at 15 miles an hour.

00:01:22.655 --> 00:01:24.667
It's not a joke.

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:26.539
Some people get seriously injured.

00:01:26.539 --> 00:01:28.920
- [Dane] Most people learn to
ride unicycle because they came

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.932
and witnessed this event.

00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:33.683
And like I've got to do this.

00:01:33.683 --> 00:01:35.789
- Once you catch that first ball,

00:01:35.789 --> 00:01:37.009
once you get that first rush,

00:01:37.009 --> 00:01:38.318
once you hear the crowd
scream your name once,

00:01:38.318 --> 00:01:41.033
it's a feeling you
can't get anywhere else.

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:44.310
- It's almost like a
religion, church to us here.

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:46.415
- There's passion, you know, it's a show,

00:01:46.415 --> 00:01:48.052
it's a spectacle.

00:01:48.052 --> 00:01:49.552
It's also a sport.

00:01:51.235 --> 00:01:53.407
I've cherished every minute of it.

00:01:53.407 --> 00:01:55.485
You can't replace it,

00:01:55.485 --> 00:01:56.318
with anything,

00:01:56.318 --> 00:01:57.909
there's nothing else like it,

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:58.742
at all.

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:02.629
(pop music)

